{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "e1b2af84-04d4-8ffd-8bca-6bc856a5465a",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T11:39:53-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Aisha Goldberg",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:15-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good morning. Or is it still morning? It's just past eleven-thirty, so I think so. My name is Aisha Goldberg, and I have a couch I need to get rid of."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Goldberg. Good morning to you. A couch, so that would be a bulk item. Is it going out for the regular pickup?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:33:43-05:00",
      "duration": 27,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, that's what I'm not sure about. I don't think it goes in the regular barrel, ha. It's a big old sleeper sofa. My mother had one just like it in the front room on Thames Street, plaid, and we all slept on it one summer when the heat went out, and, oh, I'm sorry. I'm wandering. The couch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:10-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right. So for a couch, you'd want to request a bulk pickup rather than just setting it out. Can I get your address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:22-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes. It's 400 Dean Avenue. In the Fifth Ward."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:27-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "400 Dean Avenue. Got it. And are you the homeowner there?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am, yes. Homeowner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:36-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Now, is the couch in good shape, or is it pretty worn out? Just so I note it right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, it's tired. Very tired. The cushions are flat as pancakes. Nobody would want it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:34:54-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so it's trash, not a donation. I'll note that. Is it just the one couch, or other things going with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:35:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the couch. Maybe a little side table with a wobbly leg but I can probably chop that up myself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:35:15-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, one couch. And you'd put it out at the curb the night before or the morning of your pickup day, once it's scheduled. Don't put it out early, since it can get picked up late in the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:35:33-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And how do I, um, how do I request the pickup? Is there a form, or do I just call you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:35:44-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can do it through me right now, or the Public Works office can set it up. Let me see what the next available date is for your area. Hang on a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:00-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, take your time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:03-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. So I've got you down for a bulk pickup at 400 Dean Avenue, one couch. I'll have the crew schedule it, and they'll confirm the date. Do you want that confirmation by phone?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:20-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By phone is fine. Do you want my number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:25-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:26-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0192."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:28-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0192. Let me read that back. Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-nine-two. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:34-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:36-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. Now, I should say, if you have any trouble with the pickup, or it doesn't happen on the date they give you, you can call the Public Works office directly and ask for extension 4."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:53-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Extension 4. Let me write that down. Four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:36:58-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, actually, hold on. Let me say it again so it's clear. It's extension 14."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:37:06-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, fourteen? I heard you say four. Hold on. I wrote down a four. [pause] Okay, one-four. I'm sorry, I think the phone cut a little on my end."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:37:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, that's all right. It's me, I started to say it and fixed it halfway. Extension one-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:37:29-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "One-four. Got it. I'm so sorry for the fuss."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:37:34-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No fuss at all. Anything else I can put in the notes for the crew?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:37:42-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, the other thing. I wanted to ask about a replacement. My recycling bin, the blue one, has a crack all along the bottom and the lid won't close. How do I ask for a new one?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:37:59-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take that request too. Is it the blue recycling bin that's cracked, or the trash barrel?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:38:08-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The blue one. The recycling."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:38:11-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A replacement for a cracked recycling bin at 400 Dean Avenue. I'll add it to the same request. Is the lid broken off, or just not closing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:38:24-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just not closing, because the body is warped. It got left out in the sun and then it froze, and I think that did it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That happens. Alright, I've got it noted as damaged, warped body, lid won't close. They'll bring a new one or tell you how to pick it up. If you don't hear back in a few days, call that extension, one-four."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:38:55-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Extension one-four. Good. And should I leave the old bin out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, leave it by the curb where you normally put it, and the crew can swap it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:39:10-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. Okay, so just to make sure I have it all. The couch is a bulk pickup, I put it out the night before or the morning of, and I'll get a call with the date. And the bin gets replaced."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:39:29-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's exactly it. Couch, bulk pickup, and a replacement recycling bin, both at 400 Dean Avenue, and we'll call you at 401-555-0192."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. Thank you, Lorraine. Sorry again about the number mix-up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:39:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not at all. You have a good day, Ms. Goldberg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:39:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye now."
    }
  ],
